  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fsvrve%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e556f05801baf51f64eb079db94542fd6cd7acd8.png\" alt=\"PMC\"></a><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/svrve/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/186466038ea8fdc8a1e106328e1469b76d340fd7.png\" alt=\"CurseForge\"> </a><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSvrve\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp; <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d639cdb1abcfbf97e4e313512a39293a0b55f3c8.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\"> &nbsp;</a><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/045c08f0228147ad2f1ce76cbc4be4d1e782e798.png\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fsvrve\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ccd82ceb15cb98213e7e9ef49d36ecd3bfd15871.png\" alt=\"EarlyAcces\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">你可以在KO-FI購買月訂閱以獲取更快的更新</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>關於</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">我建模並紋理了各種熔爐，將其打包在一起！你可以看到下方的非開啓版本。欲了解更多請查看圖庫或自行安裝檢查！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cc3dd5b653c925134aa51ee5030c9c59a2ecb914.png\" alt=\"Furnace\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/dfb6c8280484535c15aabdbe402d1f022c64ece9.png\" alt=\"BlastFurnace\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/495d6b6a0ab88c7e690bc61e9d7a926ee66818d0.png\" alt=\"Smoker\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>常見問題</strong></h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>如何安裝資源包？&nbsp;</strong>YouTube上有許多教程會比我解釋得更好，但請從可信的網站（如Modrinth或CurseForge）下載內容，然後將文件拖入點擊「打開資源包資料夾」後弹出的資料夾中。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>我可以使用其中的素材來製作自己的資源包嗎？&nbsp;</strong>安裝後打開你下載的文件（.zip），你會找到授權檔案，請閱讀之。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>需要其他模組嗎？&nbsp;</strong>不需要，完全兼容原版。</p>\n</blockquote>",
